    "explanation": "Poliomyelitis is a viral infection caused by the poliovirus, which can lead to AFP. The virus primarily affects the motor neurons in the spinal cord, resulting in muscle weakness and paralysis. Polio is a well-known cause of AFP, especially in areas where the virus is endemic.",
