    "stem": "In a cohort study of hypertensive men, the proportions of\nsubjects with high and low renin levels who lived for\nanother 5 years are compared separately according to age:\namong those aged 40 to 49, 50 to 59 and 60 to 69. Which\nof the following epidemiologic method was done?",
