    "explanation": "Depression is more common in persons who are\nyoung, female, divorced, single, separated,\nseriously ill or have a prior history or family\nhistory of depression. Suicide occurs in 15% of\nuntreated major depressive disorder. Depressed\npatients frequently present with a variety pf\nphysical complaints.",
