    "subject": "preventive-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 613,
    "stem": "A group of researchers wanted to study the causes of a\nrare form of CNS tumor. They found a complete registry of\nthis disease and have access to a large database of patients.\nThey have funding for only 1 year from the PCHRD. Which\nstudy design is most appropriate?",
