    "stem": "A new screening method is being studied. The following\ndata is obtained on applying the new screening tool on 200\npeople:\nWith Disease w/o Disease\nPositive 90 60\nNegative 10 40\nTotal 100 100\nUsing this data, compute for the specificity of the test.",
