    "explanation": "As a strategy, primary health care focuses on\nindividual and community strengths (assets) and\nopportunities for change (needs); maximizes the\ninvolvement of the community; includes all\nrelevant sectors but avoids duplication of services;\nand uses only health technologies that are\naccessible, acceptable, affordable and appropriate.\nPrimary health care needs to be delivered close to\nthe people; thus, should rely on maximum use of\nboth lay and professional health care practitioner.",
